sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Инженер
  participant YC as Yandex Cloud
  participant TF as Terraform
  participant AN as Ansible
  participant K as Kubernetes
  participant P as Platform
  participant V as Vault
  participant G as GitLab
  participant A as Apps
  participant T as Tests

  U->>YC: подготовка folder, SA, IAM, quotas
  U->>TF: make infra-plan / infra-apply
  TF->>YC: VM, VPC, SG, NLB
  TF->>AN: inventory и artifacts
  U->>TF: make edge-apply
  TF->>YC: DNS metadata / Cloudflare records
  U->>AN: make kubeadm-bootstrap
  AN->>K: kubeadm init/join, Calico, kubeconfig
  U->>P: make deploy-platform
  P->>K: ingress, cert-manager, monitoring, logging
  U->>V: make deploy-vault / vault-init / vault-configure
  V->>K: Vault HA, Kubernetes auth, policies
  U->>G: make deploy-gitlab
  G->>K: GitLab, Registry, Runner
  U->>A: build images / deploy-apps
  A->>K: Helm releases, NetworkPolicy, backup
  U->>T: test suites
  T->>K: smoke, network, security, integration, storage, resilience, load
